蓋飯上的配菜直接使用大片筍片、木耳、海帶絲與碎洋蔥丁，基本上就是把拉麵備料與現成涼拌小菜強行鋪在飯上，毫無日式蓋飯講究的融合感與精緻度。\n\u200b（2）令人困惑的調味：\n燒肉蓋飯直接擠上交錯的沙拉醬/美乃滋，容易讓整體口感變得極為油膩且掩蓋肉香，視覺上也十分混亂。\n（3）\u200b蔬菜與副餐賣相欠佳：\n花椰菜與豆腐浸泡在稀薄白濁的醬汁中，花椰菜色澤與質地明顯含水過多，擺盤與賣相皆不及格。\n\u200b（4）價格與品質落差大：\n單份蓋飯定價 238 元、加點時蔬豆腐 99 元，總計 575 元在百貨美食街已屬中等價位，但呈現出的精緻度與食材處理卻像低成本拼湊餐。",null,[0,90]]]],[],[null,null,46,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CTWMyTjBhVk5oYUZGRWRYaGpUbmRzU1Zad1prRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x5f6d200ca41e8c9!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnBMc2N0aVNhaFFEdXhjTndsSVZwZkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CTWMyTjBhVk5oYUZGRWRYaGpUbmRzU1Zad1prRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CTWMyTjBhVk5oYUZGRWRYaGpUbmRzU1Zad1prRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CTWMyTjBhVk5oYUZGRWRYaGpUbmRzU1Zad1prRRILMGVXM0c4RDBHZ3EaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uQk1jMk4wYVZOaGFGRkVkWGhqVG5kc1NWWndaa0USCzBlVzNHOEQwR2dxIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARyehBygDS9gUqCzBlVzNHOEQwR2dx\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiF5_S4xtKWAxXYbfUHHQdzIPkQoykIoQEoDg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjQx_q4xtKWAxUedV4EHW1hNP4Q0pMFCFAoBw"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiF5_S4xtKWAxXYbfUHHQdzIPkQ0pMFCIgBKAc"]],null,null,null,"other_user_google_review_posts__and__hotel_and_vr_partner_review_posts",null,"Ci8IARInCgoAP7_L________EhCzbthOyYkIjMWFofIAAAAAGgf_Al_rVUHsGAAiAA"]],null,null,null,[3,1,null,null,null,[2]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[7,[["八王子東京拉麵-板橋大遠百店"],["220新北市板橋區福丘里新站路28號"],["B1"]]],[2,[["220新北市板橋區福丘里新站路28號八王子東京拉麵-板橋大遠百店B1"]]],[1,[["220新北市板橋區福丘里新站路28號B1"]]],[4,[["新北市板橋區福丘里"]]]],[null,"新站路28號B1","新站路28號B1","福丘里","220","新北市板橋區","TW",["1 樓"]],["0ahUKEwiF5_S4xtKWAxXYbfUHHQdzIPkQqtMBCAsoCA",["7QQ32F78+CP"],["2F78+CP 福丘里 新北市板橋區"],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[["星期四",4,[2026,9,3],[["11:00–22:00",[[11],[22]]]],0,1],["星期五",5,[2026,9,4],[["11:00–22:00",[[11],[22]]]],0,1],["星